---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "소개";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle} showTitle={false} fullWidth={true}>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="about-hero-inner">
      <span class="about-tag">생터성경사역원</span>
      <h1 class="about-title">전 세대가 성경을 재미있게 읽을 수 있도록 돕는 기관입니다.</h1>
      <div class="about-divider"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <div class="about-content">

      <div class="about-text">
        <p>
          <strong>생터성경사역원</strong>은 전 세대가 성경 전체를 이해하며 재밌게 읽을 수 있도록 돕는 성경 교육기관으로, 성경 읽기에 필요한 콘텐츠를 개발하며 성경 일독을 지도할 <strong>전문강사</strong>를 양성하고 있습니다.
        </p>
      </div>

      <img
        src="/uploads/about-bible-study-collage-cropped.jpg"
        alt="성경을 공부하고 필사하는 모습과 생터 교재들"
        class="about-photo"
      />

      <div class="about-video">
        <iframe src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/YOOpan9uQvc?si=KlbcPAHE15XuSg_1" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
      </div>

      <div class="support-section" id="support">
        <h2 class="support-title">후원 안내</h2>
        <p class="support-desc">생터성경사역원의 사역에 동참하실 수 있습니다. 다음세대와 말씀 사역에 힘을 더하여 주세요!</p>
        <div class="support-grid">
          <a href="https://mrmweb.hsit.co.kr/v2/Member/MemberJoin.aspx?action=join&server=zR6SZZSjGXp49NHQvgAcmA==" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="support-card">
            <span class="support-icon">🙏</span>
            <span class="support-name">월 1만원 후원</span>
            <span class="support-link-label">신청하기 →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://missionfund.org/go/?pi=ahaja2006" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="support-card">
            <span class="support-icon">🌏</span>
            <span class="support-name">미션펀드</span>
            <span class="support-link-label">신청하기 →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://members.ahaja.org/bbs/login.php?url=https://members.ahaja.org/bbs/page.php?hid=support" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="support-card">
            <span class="support-icon">💝</span>
            <span class="support-name">일시후원</span>
            <span class="support-link-label">신청하기 →</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://mrmweb.hsit.co.kr/v2/Default.aspx?action=join&server=zR6SZZSjGXp49NHQvgAcmA==" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="support-card">
            <span class="support-icon">📅</span>
            <span class="support-name">정기후원</span>
            <span class="support-link-label">신청하기 →</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
